    {
      "name": "Cryptidkin (Furrykin): Wildframe & Instinct",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_furrykin.png",
      "system": {
        "category": "feature",
        "source": {
          "custom": "Bad Eden",
          "rules": "2024",
          "revision": 2,
          "book": "",
          "license": ""
        },
        "tags": [],
        "description": {
          "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Your body is built for a world that bites back. So is your patience.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Wildframe.</strong> Add your tier to Body defense checks made to resist Stress.</p>\n<p><strong>Keen Sense.</strong> Choose one at character creation: <em>Keen Smell</em>, <em>Keen Hearing</em>, or <em>Keen Sight</em>. You reroll the lowest die on Soul (Perception) checks that rely on that sense.</p>\n<p><strong>Frame Choice.</strong> Choose one narrative frame at character creation; it is permanent.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Predator.</strong> Your unarmed strikes (bite or claws) deal 1d6 instead of 1d4 and count as natural weapons.</li><li><strong>Forager.</strong> You gain a skill rank in the Athletics skill. If you already have it, you may choose another skill from the Cryptidkin list (GM adjudicates).</li><li><strong>Brute.</strong> You count as one size larger for the purposes of carrying capacity, push, drag, lift, shove, and grapple.</li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
